<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Dec forex reserves fall to $1.182 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Dec forex reserves fall to $1.182 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the monthly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan in billions of dollars:</p>
<p>			    DECEMBER  NOVEMBER  DECEMBER 1995</p>
<p> TOTAL			 1.182   1.344    2.303</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	 0.409   0.425    0.756</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan  0.084   0.241    0.825</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion  0.676   0.676    0.707</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights  0.013   0.002    0.015</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
